       "text": "I haven't entered this order yet because the dose is well above the safe maximum, and I want to check it with you first.\n\n**The problem:**\n- **Single dose:** 1600 mg is twice the usual maximum single dose of 800 mg.\n- **Daily total:** 1600 mg four times a day is 6400 mg/day. That's twice the prescription maximum of 3200 mg/day for adults. At this level the risk of GI bleeding, acute kidney injury and other NSAID toxicity is much higher, even with normal kidney and liver function.\n\n**Common orders this might have meant:**\n- 400 mg PO four times daily (1600 mg/day total)\n- 600 mg PO four times daily (2400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO three times daily (2400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg PO four times daily (3200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nPlease tell me which dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it. If you really do mean 1600 mg four times daily for a specific reason, tell me the reason and I can enter it with a note documenting it. That order would probably still need a pharmacy review."
